5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Before we move a single desk, I need to understand the actual cost of this floor.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know which spot is quietest and most comfortable for my back.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,My gaps between meetings are already tiny. I need to know exactly how much time this reorganization steals from my day.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I’m not interested in who gets the window. I want to know who gets the worst seat, and why.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about who I’ll sit next to. It changes how much I talk to everyone.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, your point about the ""worst seat"" is valid, but we need the financial basis first.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
